          "lastBuildDate": "2023-11-25T00:37:01.600Z",
          "description": "\n      The Very Veggie Silly Stories&nbsp;podcast is led by hosts Bob the Tomato and Larry the Cucumber. Each episode features a montage of hilarious, original stories, surprise special guests and classic hit songs like&nbsp;God is Bigger than the Boogeyman. The episodes are chock full of biblical lessons, silliness and fun – all coming together into a compelling story that will keep kids listening to the very end.\n    ",
